   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is supporting the implementation of UNICEF&apos;s 2002 - 2005 social development Programme in Bolivia trough Literacy and Micro-credits for Women. PROANDES emphasises the importance of developing and consolidating integrated actions in education for Women, child development attending health, complementary nutrition and early stimulation along with economic activities.</narrative>
